<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-033" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:refusal" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:refusal:m0000" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫公</persName>初受<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:refusal:m0004" ref="b21_e55_8bd">劉司空</persName>使勸進，母<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:refusal:m0012" ref="lxy_zsx_o2z_A">崔氏</persName>固駐之，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:refusal:m0018" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">嶠</persName>絕裾而去。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:family" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:family:m0000" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">嶠</persName>父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:family:m0002" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_B">襜</persName>，娶清河<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:family:m0007" ref="lxy_zsx_o2z">崔參</persName>女。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:yuyu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:yuyu:m0000" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA">元帝</persName>即位，以<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:yuyu:m0006" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫嶠</persName>為散騎侍郎。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-033-jin067-wenqiao:yuyu:m0014" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">嶠</persName>以母亡，逼賊，不得往臨葬，固辭。</p>
</text>
